    "Kontrol ediliyor": "Egiaztatzen", // EN: Checking
    "Bulut hesab\u0131yla a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r": "Hodei kontu batekin erabilgarri", // EN: Available with a cloud account
    "\u00d6nce bulut hesab\u0131nla giri\u015f yap.": "Lehenik, saioa hasi zure hodei kontuarekin.", // EN: Sign in with your cloud account first.
    "Durum al\u0131namad\u0131": "Egoera kargatu ezin izan da", // EN: Couldn't load the status
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131 kodu a\u00e7\u0131k": "Autentifikazio kodea piztuta dago", // EN: Authenticator code is on
    "\u0130ki ad\u0131ml\u0131 do\u011frulama bulut hesab\u0131yla a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r.": "Bi urratsetako egiaztapenak hodei kontua behar du.", // EN: Two-step verification needs a cloud account.
    "Kapatmak i\u00e7in kimlik uygulamas\u0131ndaki kodu gir.": "Itzaltzeko autentifikazio kodea sartu.", // EN: Enter the authenticator code to turn it off.
    "Kodu kimlik uygulamas\u0131na okut, sonra uygulamadaki 6 haneyi gir.": "Kodea zure autentifikazio aplikazioarekin eskaneatu, eta ondoren 6 digitu sartu.", // EN: Scan the code with your authenticator app, then enter the 6 digits.
    "Kurulum kodu": "Konfigurazio kodea", // EN: Setup code
    "Kodu okutam\u0131yorsan bu anahtar\u0131 uygulamaya yaz:": "Ez baduzu eskaneatu, sartu hurrengo gakoa aplikazioan:", // EN: If you can't scan it, type this key into the app:
    "Kod 6 hane olmal\u0131.": "Kodeak 6 digitu izan behar ditu.", // EN: The code must be 6 digits.
    "Kod hatal\u0131 ya da s\u00fcresi ge\u00e7ti.": "Kodea okerra da edo iraungi da.", // EN: The code is wrong or has expired.
    "Kod hatal\u0131 ya da s\u00fcresi ge\u00e7ti. Telefonunun saati otomatik ayarl\u0131 de\u011filse kodlar tutmaz; saati otomati\u011fe al\u0131p yenilenen kodu bir kez dene.": "Kodea okerra da edo iraungi da. Kodeak ez badatoz bat zure telefonoaren erlojuak automatikoki ez badu ezarri; jarri automatikora eta saiatu kode berritua behin.", // EN: The code is wrong or has expired. Codes do not match if your phone's clock is not set automatically; switch it to automatic and try the refreshed code once.
    "Kod do\u011frulanamad\u0131.": "Kodea ezin izan da egiaztatu.", // EN: The code could not be verified.
    "\u0130\u015flem tamamlanamad\u0131.": "Ekintza ezin izan da burutu.", // EN: The action could not be completed.
    "\u0130ki ad\u0131ml\u0131 do\u011frulama a\u00e7\u0131k.": "Bi urratsetan egiaztatzea piztuta dago.", // EN: Two-step verification is on.
    "\u0130ki ad\u0131ml\u0131 do\u011frulama kapat\u0131ld\u0131.": "Bi urratsetan egiaztatzea itzalita dago.", // EN: Two-step verification is off.
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131ndaki 6 haneli kodu gir.": "Sartu zure autentikazio-appetik datozen 6 digituko kodea.", // EN: Enter the 6-digit code from your authenticator app.
    "Google Authenticator, Microsoft Authenticator gibi bir kimlik uygulamas\u0131 a\u00e7.": "Ireki autentikazio-app bat, adibidez Google Authenticator edo Microsoft Authenticator.", // EN: Open an authenticator app such as Google Authenticator or Microsoft Authenticator.
    "A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki kodu okut ya da anahtar\u0131 elle gir.": "Eskaneatu beheko kodea edo sartu gakoa eskuz.", // EN: Scan the code below or enter the key by hand.
    "Uygulamadaki 6 haneli kodu yaz ve Do\u011frula'ya dokun.": "Idatzi aplikaziotik datozen 6 digituko kodea eta sakatu Egiaztatu.", // EN: Type the 6-digit code from the app and tap Verify.
    "Uygulamada eski bir NEXUS kayd\u0131 varsa sil; her kurulumda yeni anahtar \u00fcretilir, yaln\u0131z en son okuttu\u011funun kodu ge\u00e7erlidir.": "Ezabatu aplikazioko NEXUS sarrera zaharrak; konfigurazio bakoitzak gako berri bat sortzen du, eta azken aldiz eskaneatu duzunaren kodea bakarrik balio du.", // EN: Delete any old NEXUS entry in the app; each setup creates a new key, and only the code of the one you scanned last is valid.
    "Geli\u015fmi\u015f ba\u011flant\u0131lar: Home Assistant cihaz\u0131 ekle": "Konexio aurreratuak: Home Assistant gailuak gehitu", // EN: Advanced connections: add Home Assistant devices
    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan, cihaz kimli\u011finin ve yerel anahtar\u0131n do\u011fru oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Gailura konexiorik ez. Ziurtatu sare berean dagoela eta gailuaren IDa eta tokiko gakoa zuzena direla.", // EN: Could not connect to the device. Make sure it is on the same network and that the device ID and local key are correct.
    "Broker'a ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Kullan\u0131c\u0131 ad\u0131 ve parolan\u0131n do\u011fru oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Brokerrarekin konexiorik ez. Ziurtatu erabiltzaile-izena eta pasahitza zuzena direla.", // EN: Could not connect to the broker. Make sure the username and password are correct.
