    "Sipari\u015fle ilgili sorun mu var? Geri bildirim g\u00f6nder": "Arazo bat eskaerarekin? Bidali iritzia", // EN: Problem with an order? Send feedback
    "Haz\u0131r olanlar \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r durumda; haz\u0131r olmayanlar \"Yak\u0131nda\" olarak i\u015faretlidir.": "Prest dauden produktuak orain funtzionatzen dute; prest ez dauden produktuak \"Laster etorriko da\" bezala markatuta daude.", // EN: Ready items work now; items that are not ready are marked "Coming soon".
    "Apple Watch Deste\u011fi Yak\u0131nda": "Apple Watch laguntza Laster etorriko da", // EN: Apple Watch Support Coming Soon
    "NEXUS hen\u00fcz Apple Watch uygulamas\u0131 i\u00e7ermiyor. Yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bile\u011finden senaryolar\u0131 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131p kritik uyar\u0131lar\u0131 g\u00f6rebileceksin.": "NEXUSek oraindik ez du Apple Watch aplikaziorik. Argitaratu bezain laster, eszenatokiak exekutatu eta zure erlojetik alerta kritikoak ikusi ahal izango dituzu.", // EN: NEXUS does not include an Apple Watch app yet. Once released, you will be able to run scenarios and see critical alerts from your wrist.
    "Bug\u00fcn Ne Yapabilirsin": "Gaur Egin Dezakezuna", // EN: What You Can Do Today
    "Kritik olaylar i\u00e7in bildirimleri a\u00e7\u0131k tut; uyar\u0131lar\u0131 telefonunda hemen g\u00f6r\u00fcrs\u00fcn.": "Mantendu jakinarazpenak piztuta ekitaldi kritikoetarako; zure telefonean berehala ikusiko dituzu alerta.", // EN: Keep notifications on for critical events; you see alerts on your phone right away.
    "Saatinde bu bildirimlerin g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcp g\u00f6r\u00fcnmeyece\u011fi iPhone'unun Watch ayarlar\u0131na ba\u011fl\u0131d\u0131r; NEXUS saate \u00f6zel bir \u015fey g\u00f6ndermez.": "Jakinarazpen hauek zure erlojean erakutsiko diren ala ez zure iPhoneren Look-erlojuaren ezarpenetan oinarritzen da; NEXUSek ez du inolako informazio zehatzik bidaltzen erlojuarentzat.", // EN: Whether these notifications show on your watch depends on your iPhone's Watch settings; NEXUS sends nothing specific to the watch.
    "Bildirim Ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 A\u00e7": "Jakinarazpenen Ezarpenak ireki", // EN: Open Notification Settings
    "Anahtar\u0131 kopyala": "Giltza kopiatzea", // EN: Copy key
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131nda a\u00e7": "Autentifikazio aplikazioan ireki", // EN: Open in authenticator app
    "Kimlik uygulamas\u0131na eri\u015fimini kaybedersen giri\u015fte kod istenece\u011fi i\u00e7in hesab\u0131na giremezsin. Bu anahtar\u0131 g\u00fcvenli bir yere kaydet.": "Autentifikazio aplikaziora sarbidea galtzen baduzu, ezin izango duzu saioa hasi, saio-hasierarako kode bat behar delako. Gorde giltza hau nonbait seguruan.", // EN: If you lose access to your authenticator app you won't be able to sign in, because a code is required at login. Save this key somewhere safe.
    "Anahtar kopyaland\u0131 \u2713": "Giltza kopiatuta \u2713", // EN: Key copied ✓
    "Kopyalanamad\u0131; anahtar\u0131 elle yaz.": "Ezin izan da kopiatu; idatzi giltza eskuz.", // EN: Couldn't copy; type the key by hand.
