    "Hesab\u0131m": "Nire Kontua", // EN: My Account
    "Hesab\u0131m\u0131 Sil": "Nire Kontua Ezabatu", // EN: Delete My Account
    "Hesab\u0131n, profilin ve senkronize verilerin kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinir. Aktif NEXUS+ aboneli\u011fin varsa \u00f6nce Faturaland\u0131rma'dan iptal et. Bu i\u015flem geri al\u0131namaz.": "Zure kontua, profila eta sinkronizatutako datuak betirako ezabatuko dira. NEXUS+ harpidedun aktiboa baduzu, lehenik Utzarpenetatik bertan bertan behera utzi. Hori ezin da desegin.", // EN: Your account, profile and synced data are permanently deleted. If you have an active NEXUS+ subscription, cancel it from Billing first. This cannot be undone.
    "Emin misin? Tekrar dokunarak sil": "Ziur zaude? Sakatu berriro ezabatzeko", // EN: Are you sure? Tap again to delete
    "Siliniyor\u2026": "Ezabatzen...", // EN: Deleting…
    "Hesap silindi. Aboneli\u011fini Whop hesab\u0131ndan iptal etmeyi unutma.": "Kontua ezabatu da. Gogoratu zure harpideduna zure Whop kontutik bertan behera uzteko.", // EN: Account deleted. Remember to cancel your subscription from your Whop account.
    "Hesab\u0131n ve verilerin silindi.": "Zure kontua eta datuak ezabatu ziren.", // EN: Your account and data were deleted.
    "Bu cihazdaki NEXUS verilerini silmek i\u00e7in Ayarlar \u2192 \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Yap yeterli; bulut hesab\u0131 yok.": "Gailu honetan NEXUS datuak kentzeko, Ezarpenak \u2192 Saioa amaitu nahikoa da; ez dago hodeiko konturik.", // EN: To remove NEXUS data on this device, Settings → Sign out is enough; there is no cloud account.
    "Hesap silme fonksiyonu hen\u00fcz da\u011f\u0131t\u0131lmad\u0131. \u015eimdilik \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yapabilirsin.": "Zerbitzariaren aldeko kontu ezabaketa oraindik ez da abian jarri. Une honetan saioa amai dezakezu.", // EN: The server-side account deletion isn't deployed yet. You can sign out for now.
    "! Rahats\u0131z etme modunu a\u00e7t\u0131m, hi\u00e7bir bildirim seni rahats\u0131z etmeyecek. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]": "! Ez Ezarri Nahastu piztu dut; alertarik ez zait molestatuko. [EKINTZA: DND_Gaitu]", // EN: ! I turned on Do Not Disturb; no notifications will bother you. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]
    "\" senaryosunu \u015fimdilik ana ekrandaki T\u0131kla ve \u00c7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r kart\u0131ndan tek dokunu\u015fla \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rabilirsin. NEXUS App Store'da yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bu ekrandan do\u011frudan Siri'ye ekleyebileceksin.": "\"egoera\" bat exekutatu daiteke orain etxeko pantailako Tap to Run txartel batetik klik batekin. NEXUS App Store-n eskuragarri dagoenean, Siri-ri zuzenean gehitu ahal izango diozu pantaila honetatik.", // EN: " scenario can be run with one tap from the Tap to Run card on the home screen for now. Once NEXUS is on the App Store, you'll be able to add it to Siri directly from this screen.
    "\" ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silinecek. Emin misin?": "eta bere ezarpen guztiak betirako ezabatuko dira. Ziur zaude?", // EN: " and all its settings will be deleted permanently. Are you sure?
