    "Bu zaten \u015fu an kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131n e-posta adresi. Farkl\u0131 bir adres gir.": "Hau zure erabiltzen ari zaren helbide elektronikoa da. Idatzi beste bat.", // EN: This is already the email address you are using. Enter a different one.
    "Bu e-posta adresi ba\u015fka bir hesapta kay\u0131tl\u0131. Ba\u015fka bir adres dene.": "Helbide elektroniko hau beste kontu batean erregistratuta dago. Saiatu beste batekin.", // EN: This email address is registered to another account. Try a different one.
