    "Ekledi\u011fin cihazlar hen\u00fcz s\u0131cakl\u0131k, nem veya hava kalitesi verisi vermedi. Sens\u00f6r\u00fcn a\u00e7\u0131k ve a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Zure gailuek ez dute oraindik tenperatura, hezetasuna edo airearen kalitatea jakinarazi. Ziurtatu sentsorea piztuta dagoela eta sarean dagoela.", // EN: Your devices have not reported temperature, humidity or air quality yet. Make sure the sensor is on and on the network.
    "Son okunan \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcmler": "Azken irakurketa", // EN: Latest readings
    "Skor \u00fcretmiyoruz; yaln\u0131zca cihazlardan okunan ger\u00e7ek de\u011ferler g\u00f6sterilir.": "Ez dugu puntuaziorik sortzen; zure gailuetatik irakurritako balio errealak bakarrik erakusten dira.", // EN: We do not produce a score; only real values read from your devices are shown.
    "Haz\u0131rl\u0131\u011f\u0131 bitirdi\u011finde \u015fu cihazlara uygulan\u0131r.": "Amaitzean, hau hurrengo gailuetan aplikatuko da.", // EN: When you finish, this is applied to the following devices.
