    "I\u015f\u0131k, perde, kilit veya iklim cihaz\u0131 ekledi\u011finde haz\u0131rl\u0131k burada listelenir.": "Behin argi, koroa, giltza edo klima gailu bat gehitzen duzunean, prestaketa hemen zerrendatuko da.", // EN: Once you add a light, curtain, lock or climate device, the preparation is listed here.
    "\u0130klim cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n son bilinen durumu ve okunan \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcmler.": "Zure klima gailuen azken egoera eta irakurketa ezagunak.", // EN: Last known state and readings of your climate devices.
