    "Bu 8 haneli kod Apple HomeKit e\u015fle\u015ftirmesi i\u00e7indir ve yaln\u0131zca Apple Ev uygulamas\u0131yla kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Cihaz Shelly, WLED, Tasmota gibi yerel API destekliyorsa yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Kode 8 digituko hau Apple HomeKit bikotearentzako da eta Apple Home aplikazioarekin bakarrik funtzionatzen du. Gailuak Shelly, WLED edo Tasmota bezalako tokiko API bat onartzen badu, tokiko sarearen bidez gehi dezakezu.", // EN: This 8-digit code is for Apple HomeKit pairing and only works with the Apple Home app. If the device supports a local API such as Shelly, WLED or Tasmota, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu Cihaz": "Gailu hau", // EN: This Device
    "Bu QR kodu bir Wi-Fi a\u011f\u0131na aittir, cihaz de\u011fildir. Cihaz\u0131 ayn\u0131 a\u011fa ba\u011flad\u0131ktan sonra yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Kode QR honek Wi-Fi sare bati dagokio, ez gailu bati. Gailua sarea bera batera konektatu ondoren, bertatik gehitu dezakezu zure tokiko saretik.", // EN: This QR code belongs to a Wi-Fi network, not a device. After connecting the device to the same network, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu adreste bilinen bir NEXUS cihaz\u0131 bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n ayn\u0131 a\u011fda ve a\u00e7\u0131k oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Ez da ezagutzen NEXUS gailurik aurkitu helbide honetan. Ziurtatu gailua piztuta dagoela eta sarea bera konektatuta duela.", // EN: No known NEXUS device was found at this address. Make sure the device is on and on the same network.
