    "Bu ekran, ekledi\u011fin ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 odalara g\u00f6re toplar; sahne kaydetti\u011finde \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n parlakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve tonu birlikte ayarlan\u0131r.": "Pantaila honek zure gela bakoitzean gehitutako argiztapen gailuak taldekatu egiten ditu; eszena bat gordetzen duzunean, distira eta tonoa batera ezartzen dira.", // EN: This screen groups the lighting devices you've added by room; when you save a scene, brightness and tone are set together.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir.": "Etxe honetara gehitzen dituzun gailuak hemen zerrendatzen dira.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here.
