    "Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini yaz, NEXUS konu\u015fabildi\u011fi protokol\u00fc kendisi anlas\u0131n.": "Sartu gailuaren IP helbidea eta NEXUSek zein protokolo erabiltzen duen jakiten du.", // EN: Type the device's IP address and NEXUS figures out which protocol it speaks.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modemini kontrol et. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekle. Ad\u0131mlar: Cihazlar > cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7 > Kald\u0131r.": "Egiaztatu gailuaren Wi-Fi konexioa eta zure bideratzailea. Arazoak jarraitzen badu, kendu gailua eta gehitu berriro. Pausoak: Gailuak > hautatu gailua > Kendu.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device and add it again. Steps: Devices > choose the device > Remove.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modeminizi kontrol edin. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 NEXUS uygulamas\u0131ndan kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekleyin.": "Egiaztatu gailuaren Wi-Fi konexioa eta zure bideratzailea. Arazoak jarraitzen badu, kendu gailua NEXUS aplikaziotik eta gehitu berriro.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device from the NEXUS app and add it again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcyorsa QR tarama veya kurulum kodu yolunu kullan. Destek ve y\u00f6nlendirme i\u00e7in yard\u0131m sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7abilirsin.": "Zure gailua ez badago agerian, erabili QR eskaneaketa edo konfigurazio kodea. Laguntza eta gidaritzarako laguntza orria ireki dezakezu.", // EN: If your device doesn't show up, use QR scanning or a setup code. You can open the help page for support and guidance.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum (GPS) servisi kapal\u0131. A\u00e7\u0131p tekrar dene.": "Zure gailuaren kokapen (GPS) zerbitzua itzalita dago. Piztu eta saiatu berriro.", // EN: Your device's location (GPS) service is off. Turn it on and try again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum servisini desteklemiyor.": "Zure gailuak ez du kokapen zerbitzuak onartzen.", // EN: Your device doesn't support location services.
