    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131 Tamamla": "Amaitu Etxetik Irten", // EN: Finish Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilit durumunu ve enerji ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6steren bir \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f kontrol\u00fc uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme butonlar\u0131 ekle.": "Sortu etxetik irteteko egiaztapen aplikazio bat, pantaila bakarrean gelditutako gailuak, ateen egoera eta energia ezarpenak erakusten dituena. Gehitu itzaltze azkarra eta segurtasun aktibatzeko botoiak.", // EN: Create a leaving-home check app that shows devices left on, lock status and energy settings on one screen. Add quick shut-off and security activation buttons.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ak\u0131\u015fta kontrol edin.": "Kontrolatu gelditutako gailuak, ate eta energia egoera etxetik irteten zarenean prozesu bakar batean.", // EN: Check devices left on, locks and energy status in one flow when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ekranda g\u00f6ster.": "Etxetik irtetean pantaila bakarrean agertu uzten dituzun gailuak, ateak eta energia egoera.", // EN: Show devices left on, locks and energy status on one screen when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce a\u00e7\u0131k kalan \u0131\u015f\u0131k, priz, klima ve g\u00fcvenlik ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek panelde g\u00f6r. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme ad\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ak\u0131\u015fa topla.": "Etxetik irtetean pantaila bakarrean ikus ezazu piztuta utzitako argiak, entxufea, aire girotzaileak eta segurtasun ezarpenak. Bildu itzaltze azkarra eta segurtasun aktibatzeko pauso guztiak fluxu bakarrean.", // EN: See lights, plugs, ACs and security settings left on before leaving home, on one panel. Gather quick shut-off and security activation steps into one flow.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce son kontrolleri yapal\u0131m.": "Azken egiaztapenak egin ditzagun irteten zarenean.", // EN: Let's do the final checks before you leave.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otom...": "Itzali argiak automatikoki irtetekoan...", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leav...
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat": "Itzali argiak automatikoki etxetik irtetean.", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leaving home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n ve eve d\u00f6nd\u00fckten sonra a\u00e7\u0131n.": "Itzali argiak automatikoki irteten zarenean eta piztu itzazu bueltatzen zarenean.", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after you leave and turn them on when you return.
    "Evde kimse yokken klimay\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n, gereksiz t\u00fcketimi \u00f6nleyin.": "Itzali aire girotzailea automatikoki inor ez dagoenean etxean, kontsumo alferrikaria saihestuz.", // EN: Turn off the air conditioner automatically when nobody is home and avoid needless consumption.
    "Gece belirledi\u011fin saatte bekleme modundaki cihazlar\u0131n g\u00fcc\u00fcn\u00fc otomatik olarak kesin.": "Moztu automatikoki stand-by moduan dauden gailuen energia, zuk gauza denean gauean.", // EN: Automatically cut power to devices on standby at the time you choose at night.
