    "E\u015fle\u015ftir ve ekle": "Bikotetsi eta gehitu", // EN: Pair and add
    "E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodu ge\u00e7ersiz. 11 haneli kodu ya da MT: ile ba\u015flayan QR i\u00e7eri\u011fini gir.": "Bikoteketa kodea ez da baliozkoa. Sartu 11 digituko kodea edo MT: -rekin hasten den QR edukia.", // EN: The pairing code is not valid. Enter the 11-digit code or the QR content that starts with MT:.
    "Bu kodu NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda gir. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011fl\u0131ysa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle de ekleyebilirsin.": "Sartu kode hau NEXUS mahaigaineko aplikazioan. Gailua Wi-Fian badago, zure tokiko sarearen IP helbidearen bidez ere gehitu dezakezu.", // EN: Enter this code in the NEXUS desktop app. If the device is on Wi-Fi, you can also add it from your local network by its IP address.
    "Cihaz ayn\u0131 a\u011fda aran\u0131yor ve e\u015fle\u015ftiriliyor. Bu bir dakikay\u0131 bulabilir; cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda olmas\u0131 gerekir.": "Gailua sare berean bilatzen eta bikotzen ari da. Hau minutu bat irauten du; gailua piztuta egon behar du eta bikoteketa moduan egon behar da.", // EN: The device is being searched for on the same network and paired. This can take up to a minute; the device must be on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131 ya da e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Gailua ez zen aurkitu edo ezin izan zen parekatu. Ziurtatu sare berean dagoela, piztuta eta parekatze moduan.", // EN: The device was not found or could not be paired. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol. Bilgisayar\u0131n g\u00fcvenlik duvar\u0131 yerel a\u011fdaki cihazlar\u0131n yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 engelliyor olabilir.": "Gailua ez zen aurkitu. Ziurtatu sare berean dagoela, piztuta eta parekatze moduan. Zure ordenagailuko suteen hormak tokiko sareko gailuetatik datozen erantzunak blokeatzen ari daiteke.", // EN: The device was not found. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode. Your computer's firewall may be blocking replies from devices on the local network.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodunu ve cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011funu kontrol et.": "Ezin izan da gailua parekatu. Egiaztatu parekatze kodea eta gailua parekatze moduan dagoela.", // EN: The device could not be paired. Check the pairing code and that the device is in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015fti ama NEXUS'un kontrol edebilece\u011fi bir i\u015flevi yok.": "Gailua parekatu da baina NEXUSek kontrolatzeko funtziorik ez du.", // EN: The device paired but has no function NEXUS can control.
    "Cihaz yan\u0131t vermedi. A\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Gailuak ez du erantzun. Ziurtatu piztuta dagoela eta sare berean dagoela.", // EN: The device did not respond. Make sure it is on and on the same network.
