    "Klimay\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131p 20\u00b0'ye, termostat\u0131 20\u00b0'ye ayarlar.": "AC-a pizten du 20\u00b0-an eta termostatoa 20\u00b0-an ezartzen du.", // EN: Turns the AC on at 20° and sets the thermostat to 20°.
