    "\u0130ptal ve \u00f6deme y\u00f6ntemi de\u011fi\u015fikli\u011fi g\u00fcvenli \u00f6deme sayfam\u0131z Whop \u00fczerinden yap\u0131l\u0131r. \u0130ptal edersen mevcut d\u00f6nemin sonuna kadar kullanmaya devam edersin ve bir sonraki \u00f6deme al\u0131nmaz.": "Ordainketa-metodoa bertan behera uztea eta aldatzea gure ordainketa orrian gertatzen da, Whop-en. Bertan behera uzten baduzu, NEXUS+ erabiltzen jarraituko duzu une honetan eta hurrengo ordainketa inoiz ez da hartuko.", // EN: Cancelling and changing your payment method happen on our secure checkout page, Whop. If you cancel, you keep using NEXUS+ until the end of the current period and the next payment is never taken.
    "Aboneli\u011fin yok. NEXUS+ i\u00e7in Plus sayfas\u0131ndan \u00fccretsiz deneyebilirsin.": "Ez duzu harpidetza bat. Probatu NEXUS+ doan Plus orrialdetik.", // EN: You don't have a subscription. Try NEXUS+ free from the Plus page.
    "QR, kurulum kodu veya manuel katalog ile ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "QR bidez, ezarpen kodea edo katalogo eskuzko bidez gehitzen dituzun gailuak hemen agertzen dira.", // EN: Devices you add by QR, setup code or the manual catalog show up here.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrge kontrol paneli \u00b7 ba\u015flat, durdur, eve d\u00f6n": "Robot ganbara kontrol panelea \u00b7 hasi, gelditu, etxera itzuli", // EN: Robot vacuum control panel · start, stop, return home
    "Kilit kontrol paneli \u00b7 kilitle, a\u00e7": "Blokeo kontrol panelea \u00b7 blokeatu, desblokeatu", // EN: Lock control panel · lock, unlock
    "Alarm kontrol paneli \u00b7 kur, kapat, sirene": "Alarma kontrol panelea \u00b7 aktibatu, desaktibatu, sirena", // EN: Alarm control panel · arm, disarm, siren
    "Perde ve panjur kontrol paneli \u00b7 a\u00e7, kapat, konum": "Gordailu eta estalpe kontrol panelea \u00b7 ireki, itxi, posizioa", // EN: Curtain and blind control panel · open, close, position
    "Renkli ayd\u0131nlatma kontrol paneli \u00b7 renk, parlakl\u0131k": "Koloreen argiztapen kontrol panelea \u00b7 kolorea, distira", // EN: Color lighting control panel · color, brightness
    "Ayd\u0131nlatma kontrol paneli \u00b7 a\u00e7, kapat, parlakl\u0131k": "Argiztapen kontrol panelea \u00b7 piztu, itzali, distira", // EN: Lighting control panel · on, off, brightness
    "Hava kalitesi paneli \u00b7 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm ve uyar\u0131lar": "Aire kalitate panel \u00b7 neurketak eta alerta", // EN: Air quality panel · readings and alerts
    "Hareket sens\u00f6r\u00fc paneli \u00b7 alg\u0131lama ve uyar\u0131lar": "Mugimendu sentsore panelea \u00b7 detekzio eta alerta", // EN: Motion sensor panel · detection and alerts
    "Kap\u0131 ve pencere sens\u00f6r\u00fc paneli \u00b7 a\u00e7\u0131k/kapal\u0131 durumu": "Ate eta leiho sentsore paneela \u00b7 irekita/itxita egoera", // EN: Door and window sensor panel · open/closed state
    "Evcil hayvan kontrol paneli \u00b7 besleme, takip": "Animaliak kontrol panelea \u00b7 elikatzea, jarraipena", // EN: Pet control panel · feeding, tracking
    "Bebek \u00fcr\u00fcnleri paneli \u00b7 izleme ve uyar\u0131lar": "Haurren produktuak panela \u00b7 monitorizazioa eta alerta", // EN: Baby products panel · monitoring and alerts
    "Sa\u011fl\u0131k ve uyku paneli \u00b7 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm, takip": "Osasuna eta lo panela \u00b7 irakurketa, jarraipena", // EN: Health and sleep panel · readings, tracking
    "Spor ekipmanlar\u0131 paneli \u00b7 takip, \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm": "Kirol ekipamendu panela \u00b7 jarraipena, irakurketa", // EN: Sports equipment panel · tracking, readings
    "Bah\u00e7e ve sulama kontrol paneli \u00b7 vana, zamanlama": "Lorategi eta ureztatze kontrol panela \u00b7 balbula, ordutegia", // EN: Garden and irrigation control panel · valve, scheduling
    "Medya kontrol paneli \u00b7 a\u00e7, kapat, ses, kanal": "Medien kontrol panela \u00b7 piztu, itzali, bolumena, kanala", // EN: Media control panel · on, off, volume, channel
    "Ev aletleri kontrol paneli \u00b7 ba\u015flat, durdur, program": "Etxeko aparatuen kontrol panela \u00b7 hasi, gelditu, programa", // EN: Home appliance control panel · start, stop, program
    "\u0130klim kontrol paneli \u00b7 s\u0131cakl\u0131k, nem, mod": "Klima kontrol panela \u00b7 tenperatura, hezetasuna, modua", // EN: Climate control panel · temperature, humidity, mode
    "Ortam sens\u00f6r\u00fc paneli \u00b7 s\u0131cakl\u0131k, \u0131\u015f\u0131k, durum": "Ingurumen sentsore panela \u00b7 tenperatura, argia, egoera", // EN: Ambient sensor panel · temperature, light, status
    "Priz ve enerji kontrol paneli \u00b7 a\u00e7, kapat, t\u00fcketim": "Konektore eta energia kontrol panela \u00b7 piztu, itzali, kontsumoa", // EN: Plug and energy control panel · on, off, consumption
    "Ula\u015f\u0131m ve takip paneli \u00b7 konum, \u015farj": "Garraio eta jarraipen panela \u00b7 kokapena, karga", // EN: Transport and tracking panel · location, charge
    "A\u011f ge\u00e7idi paneli \u00b7 ba\u011flant\u0131, durum": "Atariko panela \u00b7 konexioa, egoera", // EN: Gateway panel · connection, status
    "Anahtar kontrol paneli \u00b7 a\u00e7, kapat": "Etengailu kontrol panela \u00b7 piztu, itzali", // EN: Switch control panel · on, off
    "Bu ad ana sayfa kart\u0131nda ve cihaz listesinde g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Izen hau etxeko txartelean eta gailuen zerrendan agertzen da.", // EN: This name shows on the home card and in the device list.
    "Cihaz ad\u0131n\u0131 de\u011fi\u015ftir": "Gailua berrizendatu", // EN: Rename device
    "\u015eifre Belirle": "Pasahitza ezarri", // EN: Set a password
    "Bu hesapta hen\u00fcz \u015fifre yok": "Kontu honek oraindik ez du pasahitzik", // EN: This account has no password yet
    "\u015eifren belirlendi \u2713": "Zure pasahitza ezarri da \u2713", // EN: Your password is set ✓
    "Bu hesap Google ile a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131, i\u00e7inde hen\u00fcz bir \u015fifre yok. \u0130lk \u015fifreni burada belirleyebilirsin; bundan sonra e-posta ve \u015fifreyle de giri\u015f yapabilirsin.": "Kontu hau Google-rekin ireki da eta oraindik ez du pasahitzik. Jarri hemen zure lehen pasahitza; horren ondoren, posta elektronikoarekin eta pasahitzarekin ere saioa hasi dezakezu.", // EN: This account was opened with Google and has no password yet. Set your first password here; after that you can also sign in with email and password.
    "\u015eifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 e-postama g\u00f6nder": "Bidali iezadazu pasahitza ezartzeko esteka mezu elektronikoz", // EN: Email me a password setup link
    "Bu i\u015flem ek do\u011frulama istiyor. A\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan \u015fifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 isteyebilirsin.": "Ekintza honek egiaztapen gehigarria behar du. Behar izanez gero, beheko pasahitza ezartzeko esteka eskatu dezakezu.", // EN: This action needs extra verification. You can request a password setup link below.
    "\u015eifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 e-postana g\u00f6nderildi \u2713": "Pasahitza ezartzeko esteka zure sartze-ontzira bidalia \u2713", // EN: Password setup link sent to your inbox ✓
    "\u015eifre ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 \u015fu anda g\u00f6nderilemiyor.": "Pasahitzaren esteka ezin da une honetan bidali.", // EN: The password link can't be sent right now.
    "Giri\u015f e-postan bulunamad\u0131; \u00f6nce giri\u015f yap.": "Ez genion aurkitu zure saioa hasteko posta elektronikorik; saioa hasi lehenik.", // EN: We couldn't find your sign-in email; sign in first.
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131 g\u00f6nderilemedi. Birazdan tekrar dene.": "Esteka ezin izan da bidali. Saiatu berriro momentu batean.", // EN: The link couldn't be sent. Try again in a moment.
    "A\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r": "Pizten du", // EN: Turns on
