    "Bu ba\u011flant\u0131 t\u00fcr\u00fc hen\u00fcz ger\u00e7ek bir cihazla denenmedi.": "Konexio mota hau ez da gailu errealean probatu oraindik.", // EN: This connection type has not been tested with a real device yet.
