    "Cihaz listesi, otomasyonlar, senaryolar ve ayarlar bir dosyaya kaydedilir. Cihaz parolalar\u0131, yerel anahtarlar, Telegram anahtar\u0131 ve oturum bilgisi yede\u011fe girmez.": "Zure gailuen zerrenda, automatizazioak, eszena eta ezarpenak fitxategi batean gordetzen dira. Gailu pasahitzak, tokiko giltzak, Telegram token-a eta saioa ez dira babeskopian sartzen.", // EN: Your device list, automations, scenes and settings are saved to a file. Device passwords, local keys, the Telegram token and your session are not included in the backup.
    "Yede\u011fi d\u0131\u015fa aktar": "Babeskopia esportatu", // EN: Export backup
    "Hata Raporu": "Errore txostena", // EN: Error Report
    "Uygulamada olu\u015fan hatalar otomatik ve anonim olarak (ki\u015fisel veri olmadan) bize iletilir. \u0130stersen a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan kapatabilirsin.": "Aplikazioan gertatzen diren akatsak automatikoki eta anonimo bidaltzen zaizkigu (ez du datu pertsonalik). Beheko aukera desgaitu dezakezu.", // EN: Errors that happen in the app are sent to us automatically and anonymously (no personal data). You can turn it off below.
    "Anonim Hata Raporu G\u00f6nder": "Bidali Anonimo Akatsen Txostenak", // EN: Send Anonymous Error Reports
    "Anonim hata raporu g\u00f6nder": "Bidali anonimo akatsen txostenak", // EN: Send anonymous error reports
    "Yedekten geri y\u00fckle": "Berreskuratu babeskopiaren bidez", // EN: Restore from backup
    "E\u015fle\u015fmi\u015f cihazlar\u0131na g\u00f6re haz\u0131r; tek dokunu\u015fla eklenir.": "Prest zure gailu parekatuentzako; sakatu bakarrarekin gehitu da.", // EN: Ready for your paired devices; added with a single tap.
    "Senin i\u00e7in haz\u0131r": "Zuretzat prest", // EN: Ready for you
    "Dokununca e\u015fle\u015fmi\u015f cihazlar\u0131nda hemen \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Zure gailu parekatutan exekutatzen da sakatu bezain pronto.", // EN: Runs on your paired devices as soon as you tap it.
    "Ayarlarda ara": "Bilatu ezarpenak", // EN: Search settings
    "Bu aramayla e\u015fle\u015fen ayar yok.": "Ez dago bilaketa honi dagokion ezarpenik.", // EN: No setting matches this search.
    "Yenilemek i\u00e7in b\u0131rak\u0131n": "Askatu freskatzeko", // EN: Release to refresh
    "Yenileniyor\u2026": "Freskatzen...", // EN: Refreshing…
    "Yenilendi": "Freskatu da", // EN: Refreshed
