    "NEXUS ana sayfa": "NEXUS hasiera", // EN: NEXUS home
    "Ana men\u00fc": "Menu nagusia", // EN: Main menu
    "Temay\u0131 de\u011fi\u015ftir": "Aldatu gaiaren itxura", // EN: Change theme
    "L\u00fctfen ge\u00e7erli bir e-posta gir.": "Sartu helbide elektroniko balioduna.", // EN: Please enter a valid email.
    "Bu e-posta ile zaten bir hesap var. L\u00fctfen giri\u015f yap\u0131n.": "Helbide elektroniko honen kontua dagoeneko existitzen da. Mesedez, hasi saioa.", // EN: An account with this email already exists. Please sign in.
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131n\u0131n s\u00fcresi dolmu\u015f ya da ge\u00e7ersiz. L\u00fctfen yeniden dene.": "Esteka hau iraungi da edo baliogabea da. Saiatu berriro.", // EN: This link has expired or is invalid. Please try again.
    "Bulut hesab\u0131 bu s\u00fcr\u00fcmde kapal\u0131; yerel hesaplarda \u015fifre s\u0131f\u0131rlanamaz.": "Hodeiko kontua desgaituta dago eraikin honetan; tokiko kontuen pasahitzak ezin dira berreskuratu.", // EN: Cloud account is disabled in this build; local account passwords cannot be reset.
    "Bu adres bir hesaba ba\u011fl\u0131ysa s\u0131f\u0131rlama ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 g\u00f6nderildi. Gelen kutunu (ve gereksiz klas\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fc) kontrol et.": "Helbide hau kontu batekin lotuta badago, berrezartzeko esteka bidali da. Egiaztatu zure postontzia (eta spam karpeta).", // EN: If this address is linked to an account, a reset link has been sent. Check your inbox (and spam folder).
    "\u00c7ok s\u0131k denedin. Bir dakika sonra tekrar dene.": "Saiakera gehiegi. Mesedez, saiatu berriro minutu bat barru.", // EN: Too many attempts. Please try again in a minute.
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131 g\u00f6nderilemedi.": "Ezin izan da esteka bidali.", // EN: Could not send the link.
    "Tekrar G\u00f6nder": "Berriro bidali", // EN: Send again
    "\u015eifren g\u00fcncellendi. \u015eimdi giri\u015f yapabilirsin.": "Zure pasahitza eguneratua dago. Orain saioa hasi dezakezu.", // EN: Your password has been updated. You can sign in now.
    "Mevcut \u015fifreni gir.": "Sartu zure egungo pasahitza.", // EN: Enter your current password.
    "Mevcut \u015fifre yanl\u0131\u015f.": "Eguneroko pasahitza okerra da.", // EN: Current password is incorrect.
    "Yeni \u015fifre eskisinden farkl\u0131 olmal\u0131.": "Pasahitza berriak desberdina izan behar du zaharraren aldean.", // EN: New password must differ from the old one.
    "Oturum bulunamad\u0131. \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yap\u0131p tekrar giri\u015f yap.": "Ez da saiorik aurkitu. Saioa itxi eta berriro hasi.", // EN: Session not found. Sign out and sign in again.
    "\u015eifre g\u00fcncellenemedi.": "Ezin izan da pasahitza eguneratu.", // EN: Could not update the password.
    "Davet e-postas\u0131 g\u00f6nderiliyor\u2026": "Invitazio posta elektronikoa bidaltzen...", // EN: Sending invitation email…
    "Bu e-postan\u0131n hesab\u0131 zaten var; kodla kat\u0131labilir.": "Posta elektroniko honek jada kontua du; kodearekin parte har dezakete.", // EN: This email already has an account; they can join with the code.
