    "Son 7 g\u00fcn \u00b7 yaln\u0131zca bu cihazdaki ger\u00e7ek \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcmlerden": "Azken 7 egunak \u00b7 neurririk benetatik soilik gailu honetan", // EN: Last 7 days · from real measurements on this device only
    "Son 7 g\u00fcn": "Azken 7 egunak", // EN: Last 7 days
    "Hen\u00fcz kay\u0131tl\u0131 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm yok. G\u00fc\u00e7 \u00f6l\u00e7en bir cihaz ekleyip bu sayfay\u0131 a\u00e7t\u0131\u011f\u0131nda okumalar burada birikir.": "Ez dira neurririk erregistratu oraindik. Gehitu boterea neurtzen duen gailu bat eta ireki orri hau; irakurketa guztiak hemen pilatuko dira.", // EN: No measurements recorded yet. Add a device that measures power and open this page; readings will build up here.
    "\u00d6l\u00e7\u00fcm al\u0131nmayan aral\u0131klar hesaba kat\u0131lmaz; bu y\u00fczden de\u011ferler ger\u00e7ek t\u00fcketimden d\u00fc\u015f\u00fck olabilir.": "Neurketa gabeko tarteak ez dira kontatzen, beraz, balioak benetako kontsumoaren azpitik egon daitezke.", // EN: Intervals without measurements are not counted, so values may be lower than actual consumption.
    "Elektrik birim fiyat\u0131 (kWh ba\u015f\u0131na)": "Elektrizitate prezioa (kWh bakoitzeko)", // EN: Electricity price (per kWh)
    "\u00d6rn. 2,50": "adibidez, 2,50", // EN: e.g. 2.50
    "Para birimi": "Moneta", // EN: Currency
    "Tahmini maliyet; fatura de\u011fildir. Fiyat yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda saklan\u0131r.": "Kostu estimatua, ez da faktura. Prezioa gailu honetan soilik gordetzen da.", // EN: Estimated cost, not a bill. The price is stored on this device only.
    "G\u00fcnl\u00fck t\u00fcketim, son 7 g\u00fcn (kWh)": "Eguneko erabilera, azken 7 egunak (kWh)", // EN: Daily usage, last 7 days (kWh)
