    "Bu evde cihaz kontrol iznin yok. Ev sahibi izni a\u00e7abilir.": "Etxe honetan ez duzu gailuaren kontrol baimenik. Jabeari gailua pizteko aukera dago.", // EN: You don't have device control permission in this home. The owner can turn it on.
    "Mesaj\u0131 Sil": "Mezua Ezabatu", // EN: Delete Message
    "Bu mesaj t\u00fcm \u00fcyeler i\u00e7in silinir.": "Mezu hau kide guztientzat ezabatuta dago.", // EN: This message is deleted for all members.
    "Son 15 dk i\u00e7inde": "Azken 15 minutuko tartean", // EN: Within the last 15 minutes
    "Aile mesajlar\u0131 ve payla\u015f\u0131lan uyar\u0131lar": "Familia-mezuak eta partekatutako alerta", // EN: Family messages and shared alerts
    "Kritik uyar\u0131lar\u0131 payla\u015f": "Alerta kritikoak partekatu", // EN: Share critical alerts
    "Bu cihazdaki g\u00fcvenlik/acil olaylar\u0131n ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve k\u0131sa metni evdeki di\u011fer \u00fcyelerin uygulamas\u0131nda g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr. Cihaz bilgileri ve anahtarlar payla\u015f\u0131lmaz; her \u00fcye kendi bildirim ayarlar\u0131na tabidir.": "Gailu honetan segurtasun/larrialdi ekitaldien izenburua eta testu laburra beste kideen aplikazioetan agertzen dira etxe honetan. Gailuaren xehetasunak eta giltzak ez dira inoiz partekatzen; kide bakoitzak bere jakinarazpen ezarpenak jarraitzen ditu.", // EN: The title and short text of security/emergency events on this device appear in other members' apps in this home. Device details and keys are never shared; every member follows their own notification settings.
    "Evden Ayr\u0131l": "Etxetik Irten", // EN: Leave Home
    "Ayr\u0131l": "Irten", // EN: Leave
    "Davet e-postas\u0131ndaki kodu gir. Kod tek kullan\u0131ml\u0131kt\u0131r ve yaln\u0131zca davet edilen e-posta adresiyle \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Gonbidapen-helbidera bidalitako kodea sartu. Kodea behin bakarrik erabil daiteke eta soilik gonbidatutako email helbidearekin balio du.", // EN: Enter the code from the invitation email. The code is single-use and only works with the invited email address.
    "Oturum gerekli": "Saioa hasten behar da", // EN: Sign-in required
    "\u00dcye davet etmek i\u00e7in \u00f6nce oturum a\u00e7; evin hesab\u0131na otomatik ba\u011flan\u0131r.": "Lehenik eta behin saioa hasi kideak gonbidatzeko; zure etxeko kontura automatikoki konektatuko zara.", // EN: Sign in first to invite members; you'll be connected to your home's account automatically.
    "E-posta sunucudan g\u00f6nderilemedi": "E-posta ezin izan da zerbitzaritik bidali", // EN: The email couldn't be sent from the server
    "Davet olu\u015fturuldu ama otomatik e-posta g\u00f6nderilemedi. Kendi posta uygulamanla davet metnini haz\u0131rlayal\u0131m m\u0131?": "Gonbidapena sortu da, baina automatikoki e-posta ezin izan da bidali. Prestatu behar al dugu gonbidapen testua zure posta-aplikazioarekin?", // EN: The invite was created but the automatic email couldn't be sent. Shall we prepare the invitation text with your own mail app?
    "Posta Uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 A\u00e7": "Ireki Posta Aplikazioa", // EN: Open Mail App
    "I\u015f\u0131k d\u00fczeyi": "Argi-maila", // EN: Light level
    "Bas\u0131n\u00e7": "Presioa", // EN: Pressure
    "Hareket alg\u0131land\u0131": "Mugimendua detektatua", // EN: Motion detected
    "Hareket yok": "Ez dago mugimendurik", // EN: No motion
    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Ezin izan da gailura konektatu. Ziurtatu sare berean dagoela.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the device. Make sure it's on the same network.
    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan, IP adresinin ve yerel anahtar\u0131n do\u011fru oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Ezin izan da gailura konektatu. Ziurtatu sare berean dagoela eta IP helbidea eta tokiko gakoa zuzenak direla.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the device. Make sure it's on the same network and that the IP address and local key are correct.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 s\u0131cak tonda a\u00e7ar, perdeleri a\u00e7ar, klimay\u0131 22\u00b0 yapar.": "Argiak bero tonu batean pizten ditu, teilatua irekitzen du eta AC-a 22\u00b0-ra jartzen du.", // EN: Turns the lights on in a warm tone, opens the curtains and sets the AC to 22°.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve perdeleri a\u00e7ar, klimay\u0131 22\u00b0 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r, s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeyi \u015farja g\u00f6nderir.": "Argiak pizten ditu eta teilatua irekitzen du, AC-a 22\u00b0-ra jarri eta berreskuratzeko bot robot-a bidaltzen du.", // EN: Turns on the lights and opens the curtains, runs the AC at 22° and sends the vacuum back to charge.
    "I\u015f\u0131k, TV ve klimay\u0131 kapat\u0131r, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler.": "Argiak, telebista eta AC-a itzaltzen ditu, teilatua itxi eta atea blokeatzen du.", // EN: Turns off the lights, TV and AC, closes the curtains and locks the door.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler.": "Argiak eta telebista itzaltzen ditu, gortinak itxi eta atea lotzen du.", // EN: Turns off the lights and TV, closes the curtains and locks the door.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %15 s\u0131cak tona getirir, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, TV'yi a\u00e7ar.": "Argiak bero tonu batean jartzen ditu %15ean, gortinak itxi eta telebista pizten du.", // EN: Sets the lights to a warm tone at 15%, closes the curtains and turns on the TV.
    "Kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler, perdeleri kapat\u0131r.": "Atea lotzen du eta gortinak itxi.", // EN: Locks the door and closes the curtains.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %70 parlakl\u0131kta a\u00e7ar.": "Argiak pizten ditu %70eko distirarekin.", // EN: Turns the lights on at 70% brightness.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeyi ba\u015flat\u0131r.": "Robot garbitzaileari ekiten dio.", // EN: Starts the robot vacuum.
    "Hafta i\u00e7i 10:00": "Astelehenetik ostiralera 10:00", // EN: Weekdays 10:00
    "Klimay\u0131 ve termostat\u0131 konfor ayar\u0131na getirir, hava temizleyiciyi \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r.": "AC eta termostatoa erosotasun ezarpenera jartzen ditu eta aire purgagailua martxan jartzen du.", // EN: Sets the AC and thermostat to the comfort setting and runs the air purifier.
    "Bildirim g\u00f6nderir": "Jakinarazpen bat bidaltzen du", // EN: Sends a notification
    "Bu senaryo mevcut cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 etkilemiyor. Senaryonun \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 i\u00e7in uygun bir cihaz (\u00f6r. \u0131\u015f\u0131k, perde, s\u00fcp\u00fcrge) eklemelisin.": "Eszenatoki honek ez du eragiten zure gailuetan oraingoz. Funtzionatzeko, gehitu egokia den gailu bat (adibidez, argi bat, gortina edo aspiradora).", // EN: This scenario doesn't affect any of your current devices. To make it work, add a suitable device (e.g. a light, curtain or vacuum).
    "Yeni bir ev olu\u015ftur ya da sana g\u00f6nderilen davet koduyla bir eve kat\u0131l.": "Etxe berri bat sortu edo bidalitako gonbidapen kodearekin bat egin.", // EN: Create a new home, or join one with the invite code sent to you.
    "Oturum a\u00e7\u0131k de\u011fil. Evler yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda tutulur. \u00dcye davet etmek, bir eve kat\u0131lmak ve aile sohbeti i\u00e7in oturum a\u00e7.": "Ez zaude saio batean. Etxeak gailu honetan bakarrik gordetzen dira. Saioa hasi kideak gonbidatzeko, etxe batean sartzeko eta familiako txat-a erabiltzeko.", // EN: You're not signed in. Homes are kept on this device only. Sign in to invite members, join a home and use the family chat.
